1
00:01:37,079 --> 00:01:39,200
Fuxia Group, suspected of Illegal Business Operation,

2
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,519
crime of accepting bribes by non-public officials and more,

3
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:42,840
has recently declared bankruptcy.

4
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,840
Approximately 13,000 employees of the group

5
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,640
are facing unemployment.

6
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:47,280
We interviewed one of the employees.

7
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,000
The company owes me half a year's wages.

8
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:52,319
Xia, please send this express.

9
00:01:52,519 --> 00:01:53,319
I've already sent you the address.

10
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:54,400
Okay.

11
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,040
As the situation is still developing,

12
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,400
our station will continue to track

13
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,000
the latest updates on Fuxia Group.

14
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,560
We will reconnect with our on-site reporter shortly.

15
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,799
Viewers can tune into Jiangliu Evening Live

16
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:06,439
for real-time updates.

17
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:08,719
Let's talk.

18
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,479
Who would've thought?

19
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,280
A massive enterprise like Fuxia Group,

20
00:02:28,479 --> 00:02:29,639
just gone like that.

21
00:02:33,759 --> 00:02:35,319
You got what you wanted.

22
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,439
Crow's feet, dark circles.

23
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:41,120
All you need is some stubble.

24
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,319
You really look mature now.

25
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,280
Isn't this exactly the look

26
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,479
you've been going for?

27
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,199
It seems that amidst sudden changes,

28
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,960
feeling an overwhelming sense of powerlessness

29
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,719
is the true price of maturity.

30
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:05,719
Thank you.

31
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,120
If you hadn't warned me the other day

32
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:10,599
to stay away from Fuxia Group cases,

33
00:03:14,639 --> 00:03:16,599
I probably wouldn't be sitting here today.

34
00:03:20,479 --> 00:03:21,680
It's terrifying just thinking about it.

35
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,199
It's okay. It will pass.

36
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,840
Don't let it get to you.

37
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:32,840
It's hot.

38
00:03:39,719 --> 00:03:41,000
I really never expected this.

39
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:43,240
I never thought things would turn out this way.

40
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:48,520
From meeting Old Kang at the detention center,

41
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,400
to Liang Zidong's case,

42
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:54,360
and then the Fuxia Group case,

43
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,680
I feel like I'm completely

44
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,680
trapped in a thick fog.

45
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,039
I can't see through any of it.

46
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,919
And sometimes,

47
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:09,800
I can't even figure myself out.

48
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:14,280
I don't know what to do,

49
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,600
or where to go.

50
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:30,959
Ding Ning,

51
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:36,160
You're the one who sees things clearly.

52
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,560
You can see through some of it,

53
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:44,439
so you know how to play by their rules.

54
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,399
As for me...

55
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,480
I really just wanted to rely on my own hard work

56
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,439
to achieve something.

57
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,480
So I panicked. I got scared.

58
00:05:05,399 --> 00:05:07,240
Why are you beating yourself up?

59
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:10,800
Doesn't our mentor always say

60
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,759
that as long as we hold on,

61
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,759
we'll eventually get to where we need to be?

62
00:05:19,199 --> 00:05:21,160
If there's any sign of trouble from now on,

63
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:22,600
I'll be sure to tell you.

64
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,879
The more you know,

65
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,079
the more you can get hurt.

66
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,959
Didn't you ask me before

67
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,279
about Old Kang's case

68
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:34,720
and what happened in the detention center?

69
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:36,839
That day

70
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:47,360
was the most humiliating day of my life.

71
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,920
After I came back,

72
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,639
I wanted to switch to civil law.

73
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,759
Can't I just lay low?

74
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:07,839
But they kept trying to play me.

75
00:06:07,959 --> 00:06:09,959
They wanted me and those interns

76
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,439
to take the fall for them,

77
00:06:12,199 --> 00:06:14,160
and toss us aside in the end.

78
00:06:15,319 --> 00:06:16,839
Even though I dodged that bullet,

79
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:19,199
I can't stay at Rujie any longer.

80
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:27,680
But before I leave,

81
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:29,759
I still have one thing to do.

82
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:34,120
I guess there's no way you'd just watch

83
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:36,040
everything happening at Rujie

84
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,519
and turn a blind eye, right?

85
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,439
You're going to investigate Rujie,

86
00:06:42,759 --> 00:06:43,600
right?

87
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:47,959
I'll join you.

88
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,959
I need to get even before I leave.

89
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:10,079
It's about the second trial for Mrs. Lin's family, right?

90
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:11,439
It's fine.

91
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:12,680
Go on.

92
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:14,920
I'm ready.

93
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:21,199
Good luck.

94
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,680
Attorney Ding, aren't you leaving a bit early?

95
00:07:32,839 --> 00:07:33,959
There's still three hours

96
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,319
before Mr. Lin's trial begins.

97
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:36,639
I checked the traffic yesterday.

98
00:07:36,639 --> 00:07:38,079
Taiping Road is closed today.

99
00:07:38,319 --> 00:07:39,680
It's better to leave early.

100
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,759
I don't want to be late for court.

101
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,639
Let's meet up.

102
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,879
You have arrived at your destination.

103
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:10,920
Navigation ended.

104
00:09:01,519 --> 00:09:03,879
Zhao Yijie, it's ready.

105
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,960
Is the freezer open?

106
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:09,320
Why?

107
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:13,080
Didn't I just tell you?

108
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:16,440
Right now, under the fingernails of this corpse

109
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,879
is that kid's DNA.

110
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:21,600
Open the freezer right now,

111
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:23,639
drag the corpse out,

112
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:26,200
then drive this van

113
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,120
and crush his hands.

114
00:09:29,879 --> 00:09:31,679
If you can't be precise,

115
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,320
the arms will do.

116
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:36,720
Then bring that arm back to me.

117
00:09:39,639 --> 00:09:41,240
Hurry up, Old Yu.

118
00:09:41,519 --> 00:09:43,720
We're out of time, hurry!

119
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,480
Make it quick.

120
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:47,039
Hurry!

121
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:02,039
Zhao Yijie, you bastard!

122
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,960
Surprise.

123
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,279
You fell for it, huh?

124
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,440
You really fell for it, didn't you?

125
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,639
Yu Songfan,

126
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:16,200
I knew you'd dare to open this freezer.

127
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,960
Because you're far more

128
00:12:20,679 --> 00:12:22,840
unhinged and interesting than you think.

129
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:26,919
Just now, when I told you

130
00:12:26,919 --> 00:12:28,960
the license plate ended in 311,

131
00:12:29,799 --> 00:12:31,120
didn't it ring a bell?

132
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,320
Today is March 11th.

133
00:12:35,799 --> 00:12:37,320
Ten years ago today,

134
00:12:37,919 --> 00:12:39,159
I took Yang Cheng's case.

135
00:12:40,039 --> 00:12:41,080
You were the plaintiff.

136
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:42,159
Oh, right.

137
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,200
Next to the cake

138
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,360
is your dividend.

139
00:12:44,879 --> 00:12:47,000
You've been too tense lately,

140
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,320
so I just wanted to cheer you up.

141
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,440
Help you relax a little.

142
00:12:49,879 --> 00:12:53,559
And happy tenth anniversary of our first meeting.

143
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,120
Bye-bye.

144
00:13:34,879 --> 00:13:35,759
Do you need me here?

145
00:13:36,159 --> 00:13:37,559
No need. Go back to work.

146
00:13:39,799 --> 00:13:41,639
Then let's take a ten-minute break.

147
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:53,759
Are you...

148
00:13:53,759 --> 00:13:54,639
Are you okay?

149
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:00,279
I was supposed to rush to court.

150
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,799
Even though time is a bit tight,

151
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,399
I still wanted to come see you.

152
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:04,559
I'm fine.

153
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,919
I knew I'd face retaliation sooner or later.

154
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:15,919
Yeah.

155
00:14:18,039 --> 00:14:18,840
I don't know.

156
00:14:20,639 --> 00:14:21,919
But I survived.

157
00:14:23,399 --> 00:14:25,000
This is a second chance from God.

158
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,600
I will definitely find him.

159
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,039
After raiding that place,

160
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,320
the team was turned upside down.

161
00:14:33,159 --> 00:14:34,759
Just like Zhao Yijie planned.

162
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,120
The team leader got implicated.

163
00:14:36,799 --> 00:14:37,679
Immediately after,

164
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:40,919
the base's files brought in the Discipline and Inspection Committee and Supervisory Commission.

165
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,919
Sure enough, they were dispatched here.

166
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,279
Myself, along with Lei,

167
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:51,080
were all transferred to the special investigation team

168
00:14:51,399 --> 00:14:53,080
to assist the Discipline and Inspection Committee and Supervisory Commission's work.

169
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:56,480
This matter is no longer on the same scale.

170
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,639
It seems over these past two months,

171
00:14:59,519 --> 00:15:00,840
you've fought a hard battle too.

172
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,399
How are you doing?

173
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,360
Have you infiltrated their inner circle?

174
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:14,200
I'm ashamed to say, no progress.

175
00:15:17,159 --> 00:15:19,000
Have you thought about other channels?

176
00:15:19,759 --> 00:15:20,720
Compared to me,

177
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,360
you're much closer to Old Yu.

178
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,559
Why didn't you go to him for cooperation?

179
00:15:27,799 --> 00:15:29,519
Old Yu is too deeply involved.

180
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:32,039
After I transferred to the investigation team,

181
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,519
I also got some intel about him.

182
00:15:36,039 --> 00:15:37,679
He didn't just take part in the false litigation.

183
00:15:38,559 --> 00:15:39,480
Even before that,

184
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,120
he had already made his move.

185
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:45,080
"For cases involving jurisdictional objections,"

186
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:47,240
"you should just dismiss them as necessary."

187
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,039
"Don't push the cases away."

188
00:15:49,039 --> 00:15:50,519
He used his influence

189
00:15:50,559 --> 00:15:52,639
to whisper in the ears of young judges,

190
00:15:52,799 --> 00:15:55,039
indirectly affecting the jurisdiction of the cases.

191
00:15:55,559 --> 00:15:56,240
Wait.

192
00:15:56,799 --> 00:16:00,039
Are you saying Old Kang's matter was also...

193
00:16:00,039 --> 00:16:00,679
Yes.

194
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,600
Ever since Yang Awu appeared,

195
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,240
in every case Zhao Yijie has been involved in,

196
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,200
he's dragged him along.

197
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,159
Yu Songfan has participated way too much,

198
00:16:08,519 --> 00:16:09,559
and way too deeply.

199
00:16:10,799 --> 00:16:12,159
But the law isn't a game.

200
00:16:13,279 --> 00:16:15,720
It's not like becoming a tainted witness

201
00:16:15,919 --> 00:16:17,399
means you can just clear your name.

202
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,200
Moreover, the way I see it,

203
00:16:20,919 --> 00:16:22,480
I don't think he really wants to

204
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,559
pull himself out of the mud.

205
00:16:25,039 --> 00:16:27,320
Yu Songfan couldn't be doing this voluntarily.

206
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:28,759
He must have his reasons.

207
00:16:29,039 --> 00:16:31,000
Besides, since the Discipline and Inspection Committee and Supervisory Commission are leading it,

208
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:33,120
I figure the Lawyers Association, the Department of Justice,

209
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,440
People's Courts at all levels, Procuratorates,

210
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,120
and public security organs

211
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:37,399
are all providing support for your investigation.

212
00:16:37,759 --> 00:16:38,759
In other words,

213
00:16:39,039 --> 00:16:40,200
even without me,

214
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,799
it wouldn't stop you from casting the net and making arrests,

215
00:16:42,799 --> 00:16:44,480
and restoring justice and innocence to everyone.

216
00:16:44,639 --> 00:16:45,639
You're not wrong.

217
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,799
However, the more departments involved,

218
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:51,320
the more strictly we must uphold procedural justice.

219
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,440
Even though none of us like the saying,

220
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:55,320
"Justice may be late, but it always arrives,"

221
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:59,080
if we want to handle the case strictly and legally,

222
00:16:59,879 --> 00:17:01,320
we just have to sacrifice speed.

223
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,200
Old Yu.

224
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,720
Are you home?

225
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:19,599
Who is it?

226
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:20,640
It's Shasha.

227
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:23,799
Coming.

228
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:26,599
Coming.

229
00:17:49,839 --> 00:17:50,519
Old Yu.

230
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:53,279
I happened to be running some errands nearby,

231
00:17:53,279 --> 00:17:55,000
so I thought I'd drop by to see you.

232
00:17:55,759 --> 00:17:57,559
I also baked a cake.

233
00:18:06,359 --> 00:18:08,079
I won't come in, then.

234
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,240
Come on in.

235
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:13,000
How have you been feeling lately?

236
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:15,400
I'm doing great.

237
00:18:17,319 --> 00:18:18,960
And you? What have you been busy with?

238
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,960
I just finished up a case recently.

239
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:21,839
Not too busy?

240
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:22,559
It's been alright.

241
00:18:22,559 --> 00:18:24,680
I just baked a cake and ran some errands today.

242
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:26,000
Let's have a taste.

243
00:18:26,039 --> 00:18:27,039
Strawberry filling.

244
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,119
It melted a little.

245
00:18:29,279 --> 00:18:30,200
It's fine. It's fine.

246
00:18:30,519 --> 00:18:31,599
I just wanted to come see you.

247
00:18:38,319 --> 00:18:39,160
Try some.

248
00:18:41,559 --> 00:18:42,400
Have a taste.

249
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,519
How is it?

250
00:18:47,799 --> 00:18:49,759
It's... it's delicious.

251
00:18:51,759 --> 00:18:52,839
I'm glad you like it.

252
00:18:55,599 --> 00:18:56,359
Have some more.

253
00:18:56,359 --> 00:18:57,759
The strawberries are really fresh.

254
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:05,839
What's wrong?

255
00:19:07,519 --> 00:19:08,480
Are you alright?

256
00:19:19,279 --> 00:19:20,440
Are you okay?

257
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:45,960
I was a judge, after all.

258
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:47,599
How did it come to this?

259
00:19:48,039 --> 00:19:49,799
What else can I do?

260
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:52,200
What is that place?

261
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:03,039
Isn't this the primary crime scene?

262
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:09,640
Where is it?

263
00:20:15,279 --> 00:20:18,720
Here. This should be the primary crime scene.

264
00:20:20,119 --> 00:20:21,839
Where is this place?

265
00:20:25,039 --> 00:20:27,519
Why can't I remember?

266
00:20:33,839 --> 00:20:35,720
I don't know if you don't like the cake,

267
00:20:36,119 --> 00:20:37,880
or the person who made it.

268
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,000
I won't bother you anymore.

269
00:20:40,079 --> 00:20:41,279
Take good care of yourself.

270
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:42,920
Shasha.

271
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:02,480
What about Old Kang?

272
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:04,200
I knew you'd be worried about him.

273
00:21:05,599 --> 00:21:06,960
But we all underestimated him.

274
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:09,039
We were afraid Zhao Yijie had people in the detention center.

275
00:21:09,279 --> 00:21:10,359
So we took advantage of

276
00:21:10,359 --> 00:21:12,359
the fact that Old Kang's dialect is hard to understand.

277
00:21:12,799 --> 00:21:15,119
We found a translator and told him the truth.

278
00:21:16,079 --> 00:21:17,279
Afraid you wouldn't understand Mandarin,

279
00:21:17,559 --> 00:21:19,799
I brought a translator who speaks your dialect.

280
00:21:20,079 --> 00:21:20,440
Here.

281
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:21,599
Explain it to him.

282
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:26,279
Our procuratorate

283
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:28,400
knows you are innocent.

284
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:30,160
Although you're suspected of illegal gun possession,

285
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:30,960
our investigation shows

286
00:21:30,960 --> 00:21:33,279
you didn't commit robbery with anyone.

287
00:21:37,359 --> 00:21:39,480
We can't disclose the specifics,

288
00:21:39,559 --> 00:21:43,119
but since Yang Awu's adoptive father is involved,

289
00:21:44,039 --> 00:21:47,039
and we want Awu to escape Zhao Yijie's control,

290
00:21:47,319 --> 00:21:49,240
we can't alert them just yet.

291
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:53,359
I've been keeping an eye on Zhao Yijie's charity foundation.

292
00:21:53,799 --> 00:21:55,599
He says he's been keeping an eye on

293
00:21:55,599 --> 00:21:58,000
Zhao Yijie's law firm's charity foundation for years.

294
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:01,240
Zhao Yijie and his people used donations in Rongshan County

295
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:04,359
as a front to buy people's loyalty.

296
00:22:04,839 --> 00:22:06,599
He says he can help provide some evidence.

297
00:22:06,599 --> 00:22:07,400
I can

298
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:10,559
give you the evidence.

299
00:22:10,559 --> 00:22:11,680
Old Kang insisted that

300
00:22:12,079 --> 00:22:13,880
if he was acquitted and released,

301
00:22:14,119 --> 00:22:15,319
he would inevitably put himself

302
00:22:15,319 --> 00:22:17,240
in a dangerous situation.

303
00:22:17,599 --> 00:22:19,319
And it would also be

304
00:22:19,319 --> 00:22:20,400
highly detrimental to our case.

305
00:22:20,720 --> 00:22:21,880
So he offered

306
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,640
that until Zhao Yijie is caught,

307
00:22:23,839 --> 00:22:25,240
he's willing to stay in the detention center

308
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:26,440
or in prison

309
00:22:26,559 --> 00:22:27,640
to play along with our act.

310
00:22:27,759 --> 00:22:30,839
You mean Old Kang understood the whole situation,

311
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:33,799
and to secretly help you investigate Zhao Yijie,

312
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:36,079
he confessed to a crime he didn't commit?

313
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:37,119
Yes.

314
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:39,599
But the department leaders disagreed.

315
00:22:40,079 --> 00:22:41,640
They thought it was too absurd.

316
00:22:41,799 --> 00:22:43,559
And the future risks were uncontrollable.

317
00:22:44,039 --> 00:22:45,640
But Old Kang is just too stubborn.

318
00:22:46,079 --> 00:22:48,960
He found the duty lawyer in the detention center

319
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:50,599
and just signed a guilty plea.

320
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:53,519
No wonder.

321
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:55,440
When I handled his case,

322
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:56,839
I found it full of suspicious points.

323
00:22:57,079 --> 00:22:57,880
I thought Zhao Yijie

324
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:59,640
secretly had someone torture a confession out of him.

325
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:02,480
I didn't expect him to actually confess on his own.

326
00:23:02,799 --> 00:23:03,400
We noticed that

327
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:04,720
you're different from Zhao Yijie and his crew,

328
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:06,319
and that was also through Old Kang's case.

329
00:23:07,759 --> 00:23:08,880
If I had known back then

330
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:10,440
that you were involved with Old Kang,

331
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:12,440
I definitely wouldn't have suggested he do this.

332
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,480
What if he wanted to go home halfway through?

333
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:16,279
Old Kang has sacrificed so much for us.

334
00:23:17,960 --> 00:23:19,759
We wouldn't just sit idly by.

335
00:23:20,799 --> 00:23:22,039
While ensuring

336
00:23:22,119 --> 00:23:23,839
Old Kang wouldn't get a criminal record,

337
00:23:24,559 --> 00:23:25,519
during his time in prison,

338
00:23:25,759 --> 00:23:27,359
we'd pay him daily compensation.

339
00:23:27,759 --> 00:23:28,599
And during this time,

340
00:23:28,599 --> 00:23:30,599
if he regrets it or wants to go home,

341
00:23:30,799 --> 00:23:31,720
he can leave at any time.

342
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:34,039
So Old Kang is free.

343
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:37,960
And the Rujie Law Firm's charity foundation

344
00:23:38,559 --> 00:23:40,519
is far more troublesome than we thought.

345
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:43,440
So during this process,

346
00:23:43,839 --> 00:23:44,920
Old Kang has provided us with

347
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:46,039
a lot of valuable information.

348
00:23:47,599 --> 00:23:48,720
It must be because I took Yang Awu

349
00:23:48,720 --> 00:23:50,200
to visit him every month

350
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:53,519
that Old Kang managed to hold on in prison until now.

351
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:59,480
Ding Ning, you have to believe us.

352
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:01,640
We would absolutely never catch bad guys

353
00:24:02,119 --> 00:24:03,359
by turning into bad guys ourselves.

354
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:05,519
Nor would we ever allow anyone

355
00:24:05,519 --> 00:24:06,759
to use the name of justice

356
00:24:07,759 --> 00:24:09,160
to create new victims.

357
00:24:21,480 --> 00:24:22,519
The body we found

358
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:23,559
is severely damaged.

359
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,799
The entire left arm is missing,

360
00:24:25,799 --> 00:24:27,119
and the right forearm is gone too.

361
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:28,720
Initial findings suggest it was crushed

362
00:24:28,720 --> 00:24:30,599
by a heavy vehicle after death.

363
00:24:30,599 --> 00:24:32,319
And the fatal wound is a stab wound,

364
00:24:32,519 --> 00:24:33,440
which perfectly matches

365
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,880
the surveillance video evidence.

366
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:36,359
Furthermore,

367
00:24:36,359 --> 00:24:38,319
for the fruit knife found at Xiao Lu's house,

368
00:24:38,319 --> 00:24:39,400
the bloody clothes, and shoes,

369
00:24:39,559 --> 00:24:41,400
we're still waiting for forensics results.

370
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:43,960
As for the missing arm and forearm,

371
00:24:44,039 --> 00:24:45,160
we must do our best to find them.

372
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:45,720
Also,

373
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:47,119
which excavator was it

374
00:24:47,119 --> 00:24:49,279
that moved the body from the crime scene

375
00:24:49,279 --> 00:24:51,240
to another dirt dumping site,

376
00:24:51,279 --> 00:24:53,400
while the driver thought he was just dumping dirt

377
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:55,240
and didn't notice the body at all?

378
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:58,519
Captain Sun.

379
00:24:59,759 --> 00:25:00,200
Xiao Zhang.

380
00:25:00,359 --> 00:25:01,079
Captain Sun,

381
00:25:01,680 --> 00:25:03,400
just a few words. It's crucial.

382
00:25:03,839 --> 00:25:04,880
I'll wait for you at the door.

383
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:15,559
Captain Sun, maybe you should talk to him.

384
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,160
Chairman Fan is really losing his mind.

385
00:25:20,319 --> 00:25:21,559
Liang Zidong...

386
00:25:23,720 --> 00:25:25,279
The death of Liang Zidong...

387
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:28,079
Was it not an accident either?

388
00:25:28,640 --> 00:25:29,440
We're still investigating.

389
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:32,319
Although we haven't caught the culprit yet,

390
00:25:34,039 --> 00:25:35,599
they are definitely involved.

391
00:25:36,279 --> 00:25:37,799
So I must tell you responsibly,

392
00:25:38,799 --> 00:25:40,279
the task I need you to do

393
00:25:41,279 --> 00:25:42,680
is also very dangerous for you.

394
00:25:45,759 --> 00:25:46,839
What do you need me to do?

395
00:25:47,519 --> 00:25:48,599
Infiltrate their ranks.

396
00:25:49,519 --> 00:25:51,039
Find the person behind Zhao Yijie.

397
00:25:51,039 --> 00:25:52,000
Give me the list,

398
00:25:52,799 --> 00:25:53,799
and I'll do the rest.

399
00:25:59,759 --> 00:26:01,440
I'm not your only informant,

400
00:26:02,359 --> 00:26:03,000
right?

401
00:26:06,720 --> 00:26:08,000
Zhao Yijie's disappearance...

402
00:26:08,599 --> 00:26:09,200
Is it

403
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:11,400
also related to the joint investigation team's formation?

404
00:26:11,799 --> 00:26:14,160
I appreciate your spirit of questioning everything.

405
00:26:14,839 --> 00:26:15,599
But I hope even more

406
00:26:15,599 --> 00:26:17,839
that you put this spirit to good use.

407
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:23,240
Ding Ning, I'll ask you once more.

408
00:26:25,319 --> 00:26:26,720
Are you willing to help us

409
00:26:27,839 --> 00:26:29,960
bring down the protective umbrella behind Zhao Yijie?

410
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:45,200
Okay.

411
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:48,440
But I have a request.

412
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,440
If I succeed,

413
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:56,000
can you protect Old Yu?

414
00:27:03,519 --> 00:27:04,240
Captain.

415
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:08,960
Captain, there are too many holes.

416
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:11,519
The clothes and pants are all luxury brands.

417
00:27:11,759 --> 00:27:13,640
The hat requires a niche personal shopper to buy.

418
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:14,519
And those shoes,

419
00:27:14,559 --> 00:27:15,599
over ten thousand yuan.

420
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:17,240
His family could never afford that.

421
00:27:17,559 --> 00:27:18,559
Who would've thought

422
00:27:19,039 --> 00:27:20,319
a thirteen-year-old kid...

423
00:27:20,559 --> 00:27:21,880
Not only is he fond of petty theft,

424
00:27:22,119 --> 00:27:23,480
he actually has the guts to kill someone.

425
00:27:25,039 --> 00:27:26,119
I don't blame you.

426
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:29,920
The time and method of the crime are strange too.

427
00:27:29,920 --> 00:27:30,960
How could a kid

428
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:32,240
stab an adult,

429
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:33,240
and two hours later...

430
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,359
A whole two hours!

431
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:35,920
And on New Year's, no less!

432
00:27:36,119 --> 00:27:37,519
go back and kill the guy again?

433
00:27:37,519 --> 00:27:39,359
What about his clothes, hat, and shoes?

434
00:27:39,720 --> 00:27:40,920
He stole them from someone else's house.

435
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:43,039
When he killed someone the first time,

436
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:44,240
he panicked.

437
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:46,079
Later, when he realized it,

438
00:27:46,079 --> 00:27:47,279
he went back to check.

439
00:27:47,279 --> 00:27:48,920
He wanted to cover his tracks.

440
00:27:49,519 --> 00:27:50,400
Makes sense, right?

441
00:27:50,799 --> 00:27:52,000
But the body doesn't add up either!

442
00:27:52,759 --> 00:27:53,799
The day after the murder,

443
00:27:54,119 --> 00:27:55,279
four or five excavators

444
00:27:55,279 --> 00:27:57,440
suddenly appeared at the burial site to work.

445
00:27:58,519 --> 00:27:59,839
They moved the body along with the dirt

446
00:27:59,839 --> 00:28:01,720
to the land reclamation site.

447
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:03,440
And no one noticed the whole time?

448
00:28:04,000 --> 00:28:06,440
That's why our guys at the burial site

449
00:28:06,440 --> 00:28:07,319
couldn't find the body.

450
00:28:07,559 --> 00:28:08,359
I just want to ask,

451
00:28:08,559 --> 00:28:09,599
on New Year's night,

452
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:10,680
or in the early hours,

453
00:28:10,759 --> 00:28:12,720
who would suddenly go to work at a construction site?

454
00:28:13,039 --> 00:28:14,480
They just wanted to make money.

455
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:17,079
Doesn't it pay triple on New Year's?

456
00:28:17,680 --> 00:28:19,039
Then... then...

457
00:28:19,039 --> 00:28:19,839
Let me ask you this.

458
00:28:20,240 --> 00:28:23,200
Did you go to Lu Zhiyong's house on New Year's?

459
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:24,839
Did you take a statement?

460
00:28:28,079 --> 00:28:28,720
Enough.

461
00:28:29,519 --> 00:28:31,640
This case has nothing to do with you anymore.

462
00:28:32,440 --> 00:28:33,359
As for you, this year...

463
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:35,039
Weren't you transferred to telecom fraud?

464
00:28:35,039 --> 00:28:35,680
You just focus on

465
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:36,920
your telecom fraud cases.

466
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:37,720
No, Captain Sun,

467
00:28:38,160 --> 00:28:39,759
he picked locks to play in other people's houses before,

468
00:28:39,759 --> 00:28:40,559
the videos are all there.

469
00:28:40,799 --> 00:28:42,079
He never committed petty theft at all.

470
00:28:42,079 --> 00:28:42,720
Chairman Fan,

471
00:28:43,359 --> 00:28:44,039
let me tell you.

472
00:28:44,279 --> 00:28:46,119
Some people are just wicked to the bone.

473
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:47,559
It's not like just because you invited him

474
00:28:47,559 --> 00:28:48,559
or his dad to a meal,

475
00:28:48,559 --> 00:28:49,440
or gave him some advice,

476
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:50,279
he'll just change his ways.

477
00:28:50,559 --> 00:28:51,279
Let me tell you,

478
00:28:51,279 --> 00:28:52,319
some people

479
00:28:52,319 --> 00:28:53,480
just love to steal.

480
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:54,880
He didn't commit petty theft!

481
00:28:55,160 --> 00:28:56,440
How many times do I have to say it?

482
00:28:57,319 --> 00:28:59,720
He just went to play! He didn't steal!

483
00:29:00,400 --> 00:29:02,400
Chairman Fan, wake up!

484
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:03,960
He didn't steal anything!

485
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:12,160
Sis, why are you so late?

486
00:29:12,200 --> 00:29:13,400
Didn't you leave ages ago?

487
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:14,519
Is everyone inside?

488
00:29:14,519 --> 00:29:15,759
We're all ready, just waiting for you.

489
00:29:15,759 --> 00:29:16,359
Okay.

490
00:29:20,119 --> 00:29:20,920
Well...

491
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:23,000
I... I just got the notice too.

492
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:25,039
Attorney Zhao is appearing in court today.

493
00:29:25,200 --> 00:29:25,920
No problem. No problem at all.

494
00:29:25,920 --> 00:29:27,640
I'm sure you and your mentor make a much better team.

495
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:33,720
Where have you been these past few days?

496
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,640
We'll talk about personal matters later.

497
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:38,319
I'm here to be your assistant attorney.

498
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:40,640
Let's go.

499
00:29:47,839 --> 00:29:50,640
All rise for the presiding judge and the panel.

500
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:51,400
Please be seated.

501
00:30:00,319 --> 00:30:01,279
The defendant, Lin Guangwei,

502
00:30:01,279 --> 00:30:03,400
on May 24, 2023,

503
00:30:03,400 --> 00:30:04,759
at 6:15 a.m.,

504
00:30:04,759 --> 00:30:06,480
after driving his vehicle for a short distance,

505
00:30:06,480 --> 00:30:09,240
was intercepted by traffic police officer

506
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,119
Luo Pingdong, badge number 410378,

507
00:30:10,119 --> 00:30:12,720
and his blood alcohol content exceeded the limit.

508
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:15,279
The first-instance judgment was based on clear facts

509
00:30:15,559 --> 00:30:16,680
and correct application of the law,

510
00:30:17,039 --> 00:30:19,279
with conviction and sentencing in accordance with the law.

511
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:21,319
According to the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China,

512
00:30:21,319 --> 00:30:23,240
Article 133, Paragraph 1,

513
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:24,359
Item 2,

514
00:30:24,759 --> 00:30:27,200
anyone driving a motor vehicle on the road while intoxicated

515
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:29,039
shall be sentenced to criminal detention and fined.

516
00:30:30,359 --> 00:30:32,119
The crime of dangerous driving is an endangerment offense.

517
00:30:32,880 --> 00:30:33,960
Its constituent elements

518
00:30:33,960 --> 00:30:36,200
do not require the actual occurrence of harmful consequences.

519
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:38,759
As long as the perpetrator

520
00:30:38,759 --> 00:30:40,359
drives a motor vehicle on the road while intoxicated,

521
00:30:40,839 --> 00:30:42,000
it constitutes a crime.

522
00:30:43,839 --> 00:30:45,839
The defense counsel may now present their statement.

523
00:30:48,519 --> 00:30:51,079
I would like to remind the members of the collegial panel

524
00:30:51,279 --> 00:30:52,200
that at the time of the incident,

525
00:30:52,359 --> 00:30:55,200
Mr. Lin Guangwei's blood alcohol content was

526
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:57,200
80 milligrams per 100 milliliters.

527
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,160
According to regulations,

528
00:30:58,160 --> 00:31:01,000
the standard for driving under the influence

529
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:03,599
is at least 20 milligrams per 100 milliliters

530
00:31:03,599 --> 00:31:06,079
and less than 80 milligrams per 100 milliliters.

531
00:31:06,359 --> 00:31:08,240
While the standard for driving while intoxicated

532
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:10,960
is at least 80 milligrams per 100 milliliters.

533
00:31:11,240 --> 00:31:12,480
What I want to emphasize is

534
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:13,920
that this concentration standard,

535
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:16,200
within the criteria for driving while intoxicated,

536
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,440
can be considered

537
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:19,559
a relatively low blood alcohol content,

538
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:21,480
rather than what the prosecutor just

539
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:23,400
vaguely referred to as "exceeding the limit."

540
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:25,960
Even if this value falls exactly on

541
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:27,720
the threshold between driving under the influence

542
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:28,880
and driving while intoxicated,

543
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:30,440
nevertheless, according to the on-site traffic police officer's

544
00:31:30,440 --> 00:31:31,599
body camera footage,

545
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:33,559
it is clearly evident

546
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:35,880
that the defendant engaged in the act of driving

547
00:31:35,880 --> 00:31:37,599
and moving the vehicle,

548
00:31:38,079 --> 00:31:38,880
which establishes

549
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:41,200
the established fact of the defendant's drunk driving.

550
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:42,480
Beyond the established facts,

551
00:31:43,359 --> 00:31:44,960
shouldn't we also consider

552
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:46,720
the defendant's subjective intent?

553
00:31:47,599 --> 00:31:48,960
Presiding Judge, I would like to add a point.

554
00:31:49,319 --> 00:31:49,880
Go ahead.

555
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:52,720
Mr. Lin's purpose for driving was to move the car,

556
00:31:53,400 --> 00:31:55,039
and he only moved it 100 meters,

557
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:56,880
which qualifies as a short-distance movement.

558
00:31:58,960 --> 00:32:00,319
More importantly,

559
00:32:00,559 --> 00:32:02,799
as can also be seen from the body camera footage,

560
00:32:03,839 --> 00:32:06,480
moving the car was not Mr. Lin's own initiative.

561
00:32:06,480 --> 00:32:07,079
Hello, sir.

562
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:08,160
You're blocking traffic.

563
00:32:08,480 --> 00:32:09,160
Please pull forward a bit.

564
00:32:09,559 --> 00:32:10,640
Okay, I'll move it right away.

565
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:11,559
I'll move it right away.

566
00:32:11,599 --> 00:32:14,000
The officer could have first conducted a breathalyzer test,

567
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:16,519
confirmed that Mr. Lin was not intoxicated,

568
00:32:16,519 --> 00:32:18,279
and then issued the instruction to move the car.

569
00:32:18,279 --> 00:32:19,640
But the actual situation is

570
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:20,839
that Mr. Lin was inside his car,

571
00:32:20,839 --> 00:32:22,960
completely unaware of whether something worse

572
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:25,480
than his drunk driving was happening outside,

573
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:26,720
or whether there was an emergency

574
00:32:26,720 --> 00:32:28,519
that required immediate evasive action.

575
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:31,599
He only received the order to move the car from the officer

576
00:32:31,599 --> 00:32:32,480
and complied.

577
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:33,440
Only after that

578
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:36,400
did the officer request an alcohol test.

579
00:32:36,759 --> 00:32:37,480
Furthermore,

580
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:39,359
while Mr. Lin was driving,

581
00:32:39,359 --> 00:32:41,960
he did not cause damage to any person or property.

582
00:32:42,359 --> 00:32:44,319
In conclusion, this is sufficient to prove

583
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:47,440
that this case fully constitutes a minor offense

584
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:50,200
with no grounds for severe punishment,

585
00:32:50,359 --> 00:32:52,200
being an act of short-distance intoxicated driving.

586
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:54,559
Moreover, regarding short-distance intoxicated driving,

587
00:32:54,559 --> 00:32:56,480
on December 28, 2023,

588
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:59,039
the top judicial and law enforcement bodies jointly issued

589
00:32:59,079 --> 00:33:00,920
the Opinions on Handling Criminal Cases

590
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,559
of Dangerous Driving While Intoxicated.

591
00:33:02,960 --> 00:33:04,400
Article 12, Paragraph 1,

592
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:05,960
Items 1 and 3, which stipulate

593
00:33:06,559 --> 00:33:09,480
that such behavior may not be treated as a crime.

594
00:33:10,240 --> 00:33:12,039
But Old Lin's incident

595
00:33:12,039 --> 00:33:13,319
took place in May of this year.

596
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:18,559
Just listen to Lawyer Zhao.

597
00:33:24,680 --> 00:33:27,359
We partially agree with the defense's arguments,

598
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:30,680
but we still believe the original verdict should be upheld.

599
00:33:31,880 --> 00:33:33,839
Because the trial judge had already considered

600
00:33:33,839 --> 00:33:35,079
the unique circumstances of this case

601
00:33:35,079 --> 00:33:38,480
and granted an exemption from criminal punishment.

602
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:39,920
Not an exemption.

603
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,160
Order in the court.

604
00:33:43,559 --> 00:33:44,240
I apologize.

605
00:33:45,839 --> 00:33:47,000
Not an exemption.

606
00:33:47,519 --> 00:33:48,359
An acquittal.

607
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:01,839
The issue with the first trial

608
00:34:02,039 --> 00:34:04,000
is not the severity of the punishment,

609
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:06,000
but the misapplication of the law.

610
00:34:06,079 --> 00:34:07,759
After all, in the General Provisions of the Criminal Law,

611
00:34:07,759 --> 00:34:09,679
there is the principle of retroactive lighter penalty.

612
00:34:09,880 --> 00:34:11,599
Meaning that for cases like this,

613
00:34:11,719 --> 00:34:13,719
which occurred before the two Opinions were issued,

614
00:34:14,039 --> 00:34:15,119
where the circumstances are minor,

615
00:34:15,199 --> 00:34:16,920
the two Opinions can be applied

616
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:18,639
to exempt them from criminal punishment.

617
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:28,800
Presiding Judge, I'd like to add one more point.

618
00:34:33,159 --> 00:34:34,159
Mr. Lin Guangwei,

619
00:34:34,159 --> 00:34:35,199
for a very long time,

620
00:34:35,639 --> 00:34:37,280
has been relying on his single salary

621
00:34:37,920 --> 00:34:40,559
to support two children and four elderly parents.

622
00:34:42,639 --> 00:34:45,920
He has to pay his mortgage and car loan every month,

623
00:34:46,320 --> 00:34:48,199
on top of the living expenses for eight people.

624
00:34:48,199 --> 00:34:50,119
But to make matters even worse,

625
00:34:50,119 --> 00:34:51,719
after the first-instance judgment was handed down,

626
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:53,719
Mr. Lin Guangwei's company,

627
00:34:54,079 --> 00:34:55,400
because he now has a criminal record,

628
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:56,400
fired him.

629
00:34:57,880 --> 00:34:59,440
This means that,

630
00:34:59,840 --> 00:35:01,800
while waiting for the second-instance judgment,

631
00:35:03,159 --> 00:35:04,880
their entire family's

632
00:35:06,480 --> 00:35:07,840
only source of income

633
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:11,039
is now gone.

634
00:35:22,280 --> 00:35:23,880
Members of the collegial panel,

635
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:26,000
Every amendment to our laws and regulations

636
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:27,519
reflects our judicial civilization

637
00:35:27,519 --> 00:35:29,119
and the progress of society as a whole.

638
00:35:29,119 --> 00:35:31,440
But if they cannot, through legal practice,

639
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:33,960
tangibly benefit the common people,

640
00:35:34,239 --> 00:35:35,719
and instead allow outdated regulations

641
00:35:35,719 --> 00:35:37,559
and unfair, flawed judgments

642
00:35:37,559 --> 00:35:39,000
to crush a family,

643
00:35:39,719 --> 00:35:40,920
then in my eyes,

644
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:43,280
every one of us legal professionals

645
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,920
has failed our profession.

646
00:35:45,519 --> 00:35:46,360
The law

647
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:49,719
is not merely a set of rules,

648
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:54,199
but a form of protection.

649
00:36:29,920 --> 00:36:31,239
After deliberation by the collegial panel,

650
00:36:31,639 --> 00:36:33,639
in Lin Guangwei's alleged dangerous driving case,

651
00:36:34,039 --> 00:36:36,039
the first-instance court established the facts clearly,

652
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:37,719
but erred in the application of the law.

653
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:39,719
This court hereby amends the judgment according to law.

654
00:36:40,079 --> 00:36:40,880
The judgment is as follows:

655
00:36:40,880 --> 00:36:42,480
All rise.

656
00:36:47,480 --> 00:36:48,079
First,

657
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:50,960
Revoke Jiangliu City Jiangning District People's Court's

658
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:54,159
2023 Jiang 0932 Criminal First Instance No. 360

659
00:36:54,159 --> 00:36:55,599
criminal judgment main text,

660
00:36:56,280 --> 00:36:57,880
namely, that defendant Lin Guangwei

661
00:36:58,000 --> 00:36:59,360
is guilty of dangerous driving

662
00:36:59,519 --> 00:37:00,880
and is exempt from criminal punishment.

663
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:02,360
Second,

664
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:05,719
Appellant, original defendant Lin Guangwei is not guilty.

665
00:37:06,280 --> 00:37:08,360
This judgment is final.

666
00:37:08,679 --> 00:37:09,400
Please be seated.

667
00:37:10,960 --> 00:37:11,920
Congratulations.

